<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Operating lease liabilities are based on the net
present value of the remaining lease payments over the remaining lease term. In determining the present value of lease payments, the Company
used its incremental borrowing rate based on the information available at the date of adoption of ASC Topic 842. As of December&nbsp;31,
2022, the weighted average remaining lease term is 2.82 and the weighted average discount rate used to determine the operating lease liabilities
was 8.0%.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"></P>

